WEBVTT

00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:05.149
This video shows how to manage inventory items and stock on a phone.

00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:15.771
Tap the menu button, open Inventory and choose Items. Each item is a card with its stock, price and a status badge.

00:00:31.981 --> 00:00:44.989
Before adding an item, tap Categories, then tap Add Category. Type a name and tap Create. The new category appears in the list. Vendors work the same way.

00:01:01.579 --> 00:01:13.531
Tap Add Item. Type the name, choose the category and the unit, then enter the current stock, the minimum stock and the price. You can also type a storage location.

00:01:39.748 --> 00:01:46.372
Tap Create. A message says the item was added, and the new card appears in the list.

00:01:58.866 --> 00:02:09.618
Open Stock Status and choose Out of Stock. Only the items that have run out remain, so you know what to reorder. Low Stock works the same way.

00:02:13.619 --> 00:02:23.243
Tap AI Suggest and choose Science Lab. A list of ready-made items appears. Tick the ones you want and add them in one go.

00:02:33.447 --> 00:02:39.351
Your items are listed with their stock, and the Stock Status filter shows what to reorder.
